stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Incompetent
    Incompetent --> Eligible: context + local state enter window
    Eligible --> Provisional: signal + evidence + resources pass gate
    Provisional --> Committed: validation passes
    Provisional --> Incompetent: reject + reset
    Committed --> Protected: structural write + postcondition
    Protected --> Reopening: explicit trigger + budget + rollback path
    Reopening --> Provisional: bounded retrial
    Reopening --> Protected: abort + restore
    Protected --> Retiring: replacement or lost utility
    Retiring --> [*]: drain + evidence retained
